LIVE SERVICES

  These are queried at runtime and their data is not redistributed here. Their
  own terms and attribution requirements apply to what they return:

  CDS Strasbourg (Sesame name resolution, hips2fits survey imagery), and the
  sky surveys reachable through it -- DSS2, SDSS9, 2MASS, unWISE, Mellinger,
  Finkbeiner H-alpha; Open-Meteo (forecast, air quality, geocoding);
  RainViewer (radar and satellite); Environment and Climate Change Canada
  GeoMet (HRDPS/GDPS cloud); CARTO basemap tiles; OpenStreetMap contributors.

